<<link `"Go to sleep - end Day " + $day`>><<goto "Day2_Night">><</link>>

<<else>>

<<if $gameMinutes is 420>>
<p>Sunday. The house is quiet in that specific early way, before anyone's fully awake, before the day's decided what it's going to be.</p>
<<if $pantiesEquipped>>
<p>Morning light through the curtains. I pull on my jeans and feel the lace adjust around my hips. I should change into boxers. I grab a pair from my drawer. Hold them. Put them back.</p>
<<else>>
<p>Morning. Another day. Evelyn's downstairs, Lily's door is closed.</p>
<</if>>
<</if>>

<<if $currentMapLocation is "home">>
